<title>SWEDEN: Swedish 9-yr bond auction oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Swedish 9-yr bond auction oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of nine-year bonds was 7.22 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1038</p>
<p> Volume issued (billions)		 2.00</p>
<p> Total bids    (billions)		 4.16</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		    15</p>
<p> Number of bids				 55</p>
<p> Lowest yields (Pct)			7.215</p>
<p> Highest yields			     7.229</p>
<p> Weighted average yield		   7.219</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
